# Nexus Industries R&D Investment Report FY2025

**Document Type:** R&D Analysis
**Authority Level:** 2 (Primary)
**Last Updated:** January 2026
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Executive Summary

Nexus Industries invested $966 million in R&D during FY2025, representing 11.4% of revenue. This investment supported 52 active development programs across four divisions, resulting in 48 patent filings and 3 major product launches.

